        },
        {
          "code": "WORKSPACE_UNKNOWN_KEY",
          "severity": "error",
          "message": "telo-workspace.yaml: 'release.units.1.context' is a setting of the docker ecosystem, which is never written flat on an entry. Write it at the anchor (ecosystem: { docker: { \".\": { context: … } } }) or for every docker anchor under 'release.ecosystems.docker'.",
